{"title": "Bonespike Boots", "pageid": 9391, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bonespike_Boots", "categories": ["Bugs", "Boots", "Very rare items", "Bonespike set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png/300px-Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f5/Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bonespike Boots image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png/300px-Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Bonespike_Boots_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Bonespike Boots</span></a> are a <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span> pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Footwear\" title=\"Footwear\">Boots</a> that enhances jump distance and gives the character access to the <a href=\"/wiki/Brutal_Leap\" title=\"Brutal Leap\">Brutal Leap</a> ability.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Armour designed for the aerodynamic leaping and striking and general screaming of your standard barbarian.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" title=\"Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boots\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 70 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic_B</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic_B\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic_B\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">23806fd3-f5f6-4ff3-826d-054afe03b7c0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23806fd3-f5f6-4ff3-826d-054afe03b7c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23806fd3-f5f6-4ff3-826d-054afe03b7c0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Barbarian_BoneSpike_Shoes</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Barbarian_BoneSpike_Shoes+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Barbarian_BoneSpike_Shoes+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_BarbarianMagical_B_Footwear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brutal_Leap\" title=\"Brutal Leap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp/40px-Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp/60px-Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp/80px-Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brutal Leap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp/40px-Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Brutal_Leap_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brutal_Leap\" title=\"Brutal Leap\">Brutal Leap</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Movement Speed\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Leap at a target and possibly knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Evasive_Instinct\" title=\"Evasive Instinct\">Evasive Instinct</a></dt><dd>You have a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> as long as you are not wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> or holding a <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">shield</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Vaulting\" title=\"Refined Vaulting\">Refined Vaulting</a></dt><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/38px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/50px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is increased by 1.5 m (5 ft).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Western_Beach\" title=\"Western Beach\">Western Beach</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-233&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;84</span>: In wooden chest <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1340&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-857</span> in a secluded passageway at the far end of the western trail leading away from the <a href=\"/wiki/South_Span_Checkpoint\" title=\"South Span Checkpoint\">South Span Checkpoint</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><b>Brutal Leap</b> uses the <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spellcasting_ability\" title=\"Spells\">Spellcasting ability</a> of the wearer to determine the saving throw DC of the target.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Evasive Instinct:</i></p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\">Helldusk Armour</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\">Elven Chain</a> lack an <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_proficiency\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armour proficiency\">armour proficiency</a> group, and so can be worn by any character without incurring the normal penalties for lacking proficiency. Because they lack a proficiency group, both armours are not seen as armour proper by Evasive Instinct and can therefore be used in combination with it.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bonespike_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Bonespike_boots_dyed.png/509px-Bonespike_boots_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Bonespike_boots_dyed.png/764px-Bonespike_boots_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Bonespike_boots_dyed.png/1018px-Bonespike_boots_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Bonespike_boots_dyed.png/509px-Bonespike_boots_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Bonespike_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2284/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45856/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12223/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1015/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1347555/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.670      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   75.670      1 -total\n 20.29%   15.354      6 Template:Icon_text\n 18.20%   13.775    